  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, ordinary mortal killer moves are priced higher than mortal Gu recipes of the same rank.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals can hold several of them as part of ordinary battle strength. Plump Lady’s upper-tier rank six kit is described as three powerful mortal killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_plump_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hair armor is a widely spread defensive technique that is still only a mortal killer move, and Dark Arrow can pierce it in one hit.",
      "chapters": [
        677
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dark_arrow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Li Shan answers Dark Arrow Immortal Gu with three mortal killer moves that temporarily seal the arrows: earth flower lotus burial, fading heavenly flower, and tree flower sheds tears. Pear orchard itself is also named among her mortal killer moves in that stretch.",
      "chapters": [
        689
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seal-work-without-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In blessed land combat, a controller can blunt mortal killer moves aimed at him. Mortal killer moves used on the cultivator’s own body can still work under that suppression.",
      "chapters": [
        821
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-body-use-under-seal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Killer moves as Gu combinations in general are covered on killer moves. Immortal grade combinations are covered on Immortal Killer Move.",
